{"reviews":[{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-0","r":5.0,"t":"I love these lashes!","x":"I absolutely love these lashes! They\u2019re lightweight and make your eyes look so flirty without being over the top.","h":43,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-1","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect","x":"So pretty, I've been getting volume lash extensions for over 8 months and I absolutely loved them but my lash tech wasn't available anymore and I wanted something for now. I bought an awesome glue, I've applied false strip lashes before so it was not hard. I love how these look, natural with volume. No one will know the difference!  UPDATE: 12/22/18 I'm pretty sure I have helped sales just by wearing these! Because I had extensions for so long, no one could tell the difference. I still love them","h":19,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-2","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent Wispy Eyelashes ata Great Price!","x":"Very natural looking eyelashes.  Easy to apply and comfortable to wear.","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-3","r":5.0,"t":"Lovely lightweight natural lashes","x":"Abs gorgeous lashes.Light and natural looking","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-4","r":5.0,"t":"My wife loves it.","x":"These eyelashes are really nice and my wife loves it. They look very natural yet elegant and she said she would totally recommend to her girlfriends. It is definitely a nice gift to the ladies.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great price to look nice \u2764\ufe0f","x":"These lashes are incredibly natural and easy to work with! I STINK at putting on lashes, and even I could do it with ease. Very happy with my purchase! Will recommend to friends and will buy again and again!","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-6","r":5.0,"t":"Natural","x":"I have trouble finding lashes that complement my eyes. Since one of my eyelids is monolid I am unable to use dramatic ones because then the difference in my eyes becomes really noticeable. I saw these were natural looking according to the images on amazon but when I got them they looked dramatic. To my surprise these lashes are perfect! They are soft and can complete a look and they blend really well with my real eyelashes. I would highly recommend these based on their quality and low price.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-7","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing","x":"These lashes are great, they look very natural and make a difference to your eyes. I would recommend these to anyone","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-8","r":5.0,"t":"Good lashes","x":"Product arrived in a timely manner. Lashes look and feel great and are good quality.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-9","r":5.0,"t":"Comfortable and flexible band","x":"These lashes are very similar to the Ardell Demi wispies. The band is flexible and super comfortable. They\u2019re not too dramatic and not too natural. Definitely great Lashes for everyday wear to give your eyes a little pop","h":6,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-10","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect.","x":"These are the best lashes I've ever bought. They're not freakishly long, needing to be trimmed. They're very soft and lightweight. They look totally natural. I'll definitely buy again.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-11","r":5.0,"t":"Wispies","x":"Just as described so soft and feels so real! Love this product!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-12","r":5.0,"t":"These are really nice","x":"eyelashes. They stay on for longer than I would have anticipated and they look very natural. I would recommend buying these eyelashes!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-13","r":5.0,"t":"They are good quality eyelashes","x":"I absolutely recommend these eyelashes ! They are light weight and look natural which is a big plus for me. Will definitely buy again.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-14","r":5.0,"t":"Lightweight, not dramatic and the PERFECT set of lashes!","x":"[[VIDEOID:2815579a9a5f52423745376cfbec092b]] I LOVE these lashes! First time using them and fell in love. They are so lightweight and not so dramatic. They are perfect for a natural whispie look. I was using the Ardell Whispies but saw these at a cheaper price and decided to try them; decision made right! I ordered more and I don\u2019t think I\u2019ll use any other brand after this. They are worth it! They are a little long but not dramatic at all! They add so much BANG to any look!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-15","r":5.0,"t":"The best wispy naturals ever!","x":"First off, let me say wow! For an offline product let me say wow! The bands are so lightweight that they are super easy to forget that you\u2019re even wearing them! I have had the same pair on for 4 days, no falling off. Even with a shower they didn\u2019t get damaged. I am struck when it comes to these, I will be ordering them over and over again! If you want a more cost effective version of Ardell wispy naturals then go with these x5,000!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-16","r":1.0,"t":"Plastic, not natural","x":"I wanted to give this a try considering the price, but I kinda regret purchasing them. They look plastic and not natural. I would not recommend buying this. However, I do appreciate the little coupon inside the box, but I don't think I'll be a returning customer.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-17","r":3.0,"t":"They\u2019re ok","x":"These are ok, bought them to try to change up my original style (ardelle wispy) but these don\u2019t even compare. They feel kind of stiff and plasticky and would lose shape quickly. I\u2019ll just stick to ardell","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-18","r":3.0,"t":"Meh","x":"They look good but I had a difficult time using one pair more than once. Other brands I have used allow me to reuse them multiple times before discarding. This brand but only allow one use per set.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-19","r":5.0,"t":"PERF NATURAL LOOK","x":"These eyelashes remind me of the demi wispies! They are very very similar to one another. They are the perfect everyday look especially if you\u2019re going for a natural look. Loveee them!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-20","r":5.0,"t":"Not bad at all","x":"They look natural Like you just have on a little mascara Which was great for me to wear to work everyday Also you can rewear them just don\u2019t put too much glue Worth the money","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-21","r":5.0,"t":"Loved them","x":"I loved these eyelashes! They were the perfect length. They fit my eyes perfectly and they looked natural.  Great buy for the price :)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-22","r":5.0,"t":"These lashes really do work!","x":"Got so many compliments on my lashes when I wear these. The quality is great too. People thought I got eyelash extensions.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-23","r":5.0,"t":"Wispie but natural lashes!","x":"They are wispie like advertised! They look so cute. Only dislike is the end of the wings they are too long for my liking.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07H8Z3SMK-24","r":2.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"Was not able to bet these to stick to save my life. Even tried 3 different types of eyelash glue. Don\u2019t waste your money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the lashes as natural-looking.","cites":[2,3,4,5,6,8,11,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers find the lashes lightweight and comfortable to wear.","cites":[1,3,4,10,11,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the lashes are easy to apply.","cites":[3,6]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the value and price.","cites":[3,6,15]},{"text":"One reviewer felt the lashes looked more dramatic than expected.","cites":[7]}]},"qa":[]}